            "review_title": "Review at Rauta house café",
            "review_text": "LunaNguyen94\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam16 contributions\n1\nSweet decor, vintage place\nDec 2017 • Friends\nYou want a place to study -> come\nYou want a place to cry -> come\nYou want a place to rest after lunch -> come\nYou want a romantic place to flirt -> come\nThis place is usually full in daylight with students, learners\nBut in the evening, it's so romantic for couples\nIt's small, quiet, peaceful\nRead more\nWritten June 11, 2018",
