            "review_title": "Review at Rauta house café",
            "review_text": "Trang N\nHanoi, Vietnam18 contributions\n0\nGood for every occasion\nJan 2016 • Business\nThe setting was delicately arranged. The coffee shop is suitable for anything: whether you want a corner for yourself, quietly looking at other people; or if you travel in group and want some place to share your ideas and talk. Furniture are comfy, and drinks are quite good. It also has discount for cyclists, so don't hesitate to show you are to support the environment.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 20, 2016",
